---
description: Core product vision and non-negotiable product principles.
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- This product is a combat-sports workout planner, guided workout player, journal, and post-workout analysis application.
- Every workout has three phases: planning, guided execution, and post-workout feedback.
- The MVP disciplines are Boxing, Kickboxing, Muay Thai, K-1, and MMA Striking.
- The primary device is a smartphone, but the app must remain responsive on desktop.
- The user-facing MVP language is Polish.
- Code, database identifiers, file names, and technical naming are English.
- Before changing product behavior, read the relevant specification in `docs/`.
- Do not invent new product requirements or silently expand the MVP.
